knife, scalpel, Sor. 2.63 ;
bladeof a scalpel, Hippiatr. 20 ;
small bladein a machine, Hero Spir. 1.42 ; name of a measure of capacity, ἐλαίου ς. ἓν ἐσφραγισμένον
