(iv A.D.), cf. 3.1266 (
a). 7
(ii A.D.), etc.

σπειρ-ηδόν,Adv.
in coils, Opp. H. 1.516 , Philum. Ven. 22.2 ;
in a ring,
AP 9.301 ( Secund. );
in zig-zag lines(=σπυριδόν, q.v.),γράφεινSch. D.T. p.484 H. ( σπεῖρα
11
) of troops,
in maniples, manipulatim, Plb. 5.4.9 , LXX 2 Ma. 5.2 ; ἡ ς. μάχη
